      {
        "sid": "BOOK_011_2",
        "book_id_anon": "BOOK_011",
        "cell": "CELL_B",
        "sentence": "All the credit goes to my granddad,” Justin answered, hooking a thumb over his shoulder to the bar, at the white-haired man standing behind it, still chatting with the customers. “",
